            <title>[IGNITE-6529] JDBC drivers don&apos;t provide correct metadata about  columns&apos; nullability</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-6529</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
